  "rationale": "Re-keyed to the god-agency build, so both gates measure one build. god-agency (0.7.0) moves the provenance contentHash by adding content inside contentRevision. Unlike the five-year gate, movement here would be real: twenty years is long enough for ascension and stagnation to terminate a run, which nothing could do before this change. These numbers are a measurement and not a balance claim -- release-plan.md forbids any balance claim before 0.5.0 -- and they still describe a universe degenerate in known ways: all 200 runs are the passive control, which submits no god verb, so no strategy is exercised; and library depth stays near 1.7 distinct nodes against several hundred grimoires, because the scribable list is cost-ordered and the same cheap nodes are copied over and over.",
